# Retell AI Voice Agent Configuration
# STEP 1: Get your API key from https://dashboard.retellai.com/settings/api-keys
# STEP 2: Get phone number from https://dashboard.retellai.com/phone-numbers (optional)
# STEP 3: Replace the values below with your actual credentials

